{"id": "EUVD-2026-78649", "enisaUuid": "fc7533ab-7b8a-3401-8e6f-04b467908b74", "description": "Vikunja before 2.6.0 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability in CalDAV BasicAuth endpoints that lack rate limiting protection. Remote unauthenticated attackers can issue unbounded credential-guessing requests against /dav, /.well-known, and /feeds routes to bypass the instance's anti-brute-force controls and compromise password-only accounts.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T15:18:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-15T15:55:04", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/go-vikunja/vikunja/security/advisories/GHSA-m469-88xx-8rx2", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/vikunja-before-2.6.0-authentication-bypass-via-caldav-basicauth"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-91973", "GHSA-p2vv-wrh8-x466", "GHSA-m469-88xx-8rx2"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.67, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ef7d6265-e7ca-37e3-bee9-b5988528b971", "product": {"name": "vikunja", "vendor": {"name": "go-vikunja"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.6.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "791c3434-1be9-3d26-94f8-f3434c507a65", "vendor": {"name": "go-vikunja"}}], "isExploited": false}